---
// Drop-in analytics. Lives in a component rather than inline in BaseLayout so
// the portfolio page can opt in with one import even if it uses its own layout.
//
// Note the absence of is:inline: unlike the theme script, this *should* be a
// deferred module. It bundles through Vite (so the import resolves), runs after
// first paint, and cannot delay rendering. docs/design.md allows the analytics
// path to be the JS-heavy part of the site; it does not allow it to be in the
// way of the text.
---

<script>
  import '../scripts/analytics';
</script>
